=== v8 / A4: ANOTHER NODE CANNOT SPEND THIS TOKEN ===
    rpi1 (registered, trusted) builds the full receipt chain but presents
    rpi3's token. Pre-v8 validate_for_use never checked the signer; now
    cap_token.move asserts signer == requester == token.owner - and Sui
    itself refuses to let rpi1 put an object it does not own in a tx.
